WEBVTT

00:03.750 --> 00:06.320
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.500 --> 00:10.430
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.440 --> 00:14.030
What he is?

00:14.220 --> 00:18.610
What he wants?

00:22.280 --> 00:29.690
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.690 --> 00:34.760
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:37.040 --> 00:44.020
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.440 --> 00:51.890
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.690 --> 00:57.180
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.400 --> 01:00.690
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:01.040 --> 01:04.540
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.760 --> 01:08.120
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.420 --> 01:11.950
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:12.150 --> 01:15.500
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.820 --> 01:19.340
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.340 --> 01:24.250
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.820 --> 01:35.280
Robot Express

01:51.310 --> 01:55.130
Good evening, Dr. Ochanomizu.
I had your car brought to the front.

01:55.190 --> 01:58.890
Oh, that's a big help.
I got all caught up with my research.

01:58.920 --> 02:00.790
Now it's so late.

02:02.650 --> 02:03.940
Who is it?

02:12.370 --> 02:13.590
Hurry!

02:15.310 --> 02:20.840
So how do you like it? Beautiful, isn't it?
Destruction is the ultimate form of art

02:20.890 --> 02:25.780
Within three weeks,
you will all learn that firsthand.

02:28.710 --> 02:31.050
Within three weeks?

02:42.810 --> 02:45.530
After eight long years
of construction...

02:45.570 --> 02:51.180
the Intercontinental Underground Railway,
Geo Line is finally ready for full operation.

02:51.450 --> 02:57.180
The people who have gathered here
today for the opening ceremony
all look happy and excited.

02:58.990 --> 03:02.820
Doctor, that warning is
bothering you, isn't it?

03:04.860 --> 03:09.560
It's been exactly three weeks since then.
I hope nothing happens.

03:09.700 --> 03:11.340
I hope so too.

03:12.540 --> 03:16.490
Thank you for waiting.
Here is Neon Lights.

03:40.670 --> 03:44.630
It reaches its final destination,
Metro City, in only five hours.

03:44.820 --> 03:48.440
It's our dream come true.
The Robot Super Express, Neon Lights!

03:49.900 --> 03:52.630
Dr. Ochanomizu,
we hear that Neon Lights...

03:52.630 --> 03:56.120
is the first entirely
robotic train in history.

03:56.180 --> 03:57.180
That's correct.

03:57.240 --> 04:03.210
Existing trains simply run
according to a pre-programmed schedule.

04:03.680 --> 04:07.240
Neon Lights, however,
operates on his own will.

04:07.280 --> 04:09.550
No matter what type
of accidents occur...

04:09.630 --> 04:13.440
he will be able to respond
immediately on his own.

04:13.500 --> 04:19.390
I see. So it truly is the ultimate work
of art science can bring us today.

04:23.540 --> 04:24.730
Hands up!

04:32.520 --> 04:39.220
Dr. Kato! You're under arrest for
the bombing of the Ministry of Science!

04:41.490 --> 04:46.900
Neon Lights is now ready for
the five-hour journey to Metro City.

04:56.570 --> 04:58.450
Detective Tawashi!

04:58.480 --> 05:00.840
Doctor, you can feel safe now.

05:00.850 --> 05:04.270
We've arrested the man responsible
for the Ministry of Science bombing!

05:04.340 --> 05:06.860
That's great, doctor!

05:08.440 --> 05:13.360
Now we can enjoy our trip
without any worries.

05:15.390 --> 05:16.560
Here you go.

05:16.560 --> 05:18.130
It looks good!

05:18.130 --> 05:19.900
Thank you very much.

05:20.330 --> 05:21.540
See you later!

05:21.540 --> 05:22.720
Oh, God!

05:23.600 --> 05:25.400
Look at what you did!

05:25.700 --> 05:28.610
What are you going to do about this?

05:29.090 --> 05:30.490
I'm so sorry.

05:30.530 --> 05:33.440
Sorry? Is that all?
I don't have a change of clothes!

05:33.510 --> 05:35.010
Please leave it to me!

05:35.040 --> 05:40.820
Wash. Wipe, wipe. Dry.

05:42.420 --> 05:45.720
Cleaning is now complete, ma'am.

05:45.860 --> 05:49.760
Really? In that case,
I guess this is acceptable.

05:51.700 --> 05:54.210
Thank you, Neon!

05:54.470 --> 05:56.270
You're very welcome.

05:59.770 --> 06:03.350
You were fired for secretly developing
weapons at the Ministry of Science.

06:03.350 --> 06:05.410
You blame your termination on...

06:05.420 --> 06:09.160
Dr. Ochanomizu, so you sought revenge.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.650
Isn't that correct, Dr. Kato?

06:12.780 --> 06:14.400
Art.

06:14.420 --> 06:15.780
What?

06:15.920 --> 06:22.000
Destruction leads to the production of new
creations. In other words, destruction is art.

06:22.190 --> 06:24.950
What in the world are you saying?

06:25.100 --> 06:29.250
Neon Lights should be entering
the tunnel about now.

06:29.250 --> 06:30.670
What?

06:31.500 --> 06:34.530
Neon Lights,
report your current status.

06:34.970 --> 06:39.280
We have just passed through the city.
Slowly increasing speed.

06:40.110 --> 06:43.300
Current speed is approximately
600 kilometers per hour.

06:43.300 --> 06:45.890
Now approaching
underground tunnel.

06:46.530 --> 06:49.720
Chief, there's an urgent call
from the police department.

06:51.220 --> 06:53.670
What? A bomb on the Geo Line?

06:53.690 --> 06:58.330
It's set to go off at the entrance
to the tunnel as the train enters.

06:58.500 --> 07:00.830
Stop Neo Lights immediately!

07:01.100 --> 07:05.790
Did you hear that, Neo Lights? Make an
emergency stop before you reach the tunnel!

07:05.850 --> 07:07.850
I can't!
I don't have enough distance!

07:07.850 --> 07:10.170
Even if I brake now,
I won't be able to stop in time!

07:10.200 --> 07:13.320
I will speed up and pass through
the tunnel before it explodes!

07:38.100 --> 07:40.040
Dr. Ochanomizu, we have a problem!

07:40.040 --> 07:41.780
We've lost them!

07:41.840 --> 07:45.470
Neon Lights, come in, please.
Neon Lights!

07:48.510 --> 07:49.730
What?

07:49.880 --> 07:54.040
We're afraid the communications antenna
was destroyed in the explosion.

07:54.050 --> 07:55.710
Darn!

07:56.620 --> 08:01.320
Destruction is art.
The ultimate art.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.170
Neon Lights!

08:12.440 --> 08:16.070
I was waiting for you,
Dr. Ochanomizu and Atom.

08:16.100 --> 08:21.030
Something terrible seems to be
happening out there.

08:21.050 --> 08:23.000
The tunnel entrance was bombed...

08:23.000 --> 08:25.500
and communication with Control
has been disrupted.

08:25.520 --> 08:29.620
Soon afterwards, I heard a switch
turn on somewhere inside me.

08:29.630 --> 08:30.850
A switch?

08:30.850 --> 08:34.230
The same bomb-switch
sound I heard.

08:34.430 --> 08:39.290
That means a bomb that was installed
somewhere on this train has activated.

08:39.360 --> 08:43.870
Neon Lights! Scan all the cars
and find the bomb!

08:43.890 --> 08:47.040
In order to do that, I need to
turn off the lights in all cars.

08:47.060 --> 08:49.010
But if I do that, the passengers...

08:49.010 --> 08:52.740
You're right. If they find out
what's going on, they'll panic.

08:53.320 --> 08:56.640
Dr. Ochanomizu,
I have a great idea!

09:02.390 --> 09:06.630
Ladies and gentlemen, I am
Dr. Ochanomizu of the Ministry of Science.

09:06.760 --> 09:09.700
Soon we will be turning off
the lights in the cars.

09:09.800 --> 09:14.580
Please enjoy the music
and light show.

09:26.710 --> 09:29.900
Beautiful! Fantastic!

09:39.480 --> 09:40.700
There it is!

09:40.730 --> 09:41.490
This is...

09:41.490 --> 09:43.170
The kitchen in the dining car.

09:43.170 --> 09:44.430
Let's go, Atom!

09:44.430 --> 09:45.490
Yes, sir!

09:48.730 --> 09:54.240
Neon Lights passed through the tunnel at
750 kilometers per hour escaping the explosion.

09:54.350 --> 09:57.830
Sorry to disappoint, Kato,
but this is the end.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.770
What's so funny?

10:01.070 --> 10:05.280
Neon Lights has achieved a speed
of over 700 kilometers per hour.

10:05.350 --> 10:08.550
Unfortunately for you,
this is but the beginning.

10:08.590 --> 10:11.160
The beginning? Don't tell me...

10:11.330 --> 10:13.690
Neon Lights should be
slowing down about now...

10:13.730 --> 10:18.640
in order to take the first curve
at below 700 kilometers per hour.

10:33.920 --> 10:35.200
All right.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.240
There it is!

10:46.960 --> 10:48.730
Atom, hand it to me.

10:48.780 --> 10:49.730
Yes, sir.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.230
This is...

10:52.330 --> 10:54.280
Hasn't communication
been restored yet?

10:54.280 --> 10:55.260
Yes, sir.

10:55.500 --> 10:59.370
We need to contact Neon Lights
as soon as possible!

10:59.540 --> 11:01.880
Don't slow down at the curve!

11:02.070 --> 11:03.800
The bomb will...

11:07.380 --> 11:10.770
Sorry, but this isn't
what you're looking for...

11:10.770 --> 11:15.270
But since you found me, I'll let you in
on a little secret as consolation.

11:15.290 --> 11:19.070
If the train slows to less than
700 kilometers per hour, the bomb will go...

11:21.160 --> 11:23.650
Did I hear ''bomb''?

11:29.560 --> 11:32.900
Neon Lights!
Don't slow down!

11:32.970 --> 11:37.350
That's impossible! I can't make
this curve at faster than 700 kilometers.

11:37.440 --> 11:41.790
But a bomb somewhere else will go off...

11:41.790 --> 11:44.230
if your speed drops below 700!

11:44.230 --> 11:48.690
Neon Lights, I'll help you from outside.
So please don't slow down.

11:48.690 --> 11:50.950
All right.
I'll give it a try.

11:50.990 --> 11:52.970
I'm counting on the both of you.

11:52.990 --> 11:55.760
Atom, take this
communication device with you.

11:55.760 --> 11:56.830
Yes, sir.

11:58.460 --> 12:01.780
Neon Lights! Hang in there
and pull through this!

12:28.420 --> 12:32.140
That's it, Atom!
Neon Lights, just a little longer!

12:40.000 --> 12:42.900
Dr. Ochanomizu, we did it!

12:42.910 --> 12:45.060
Great job, Atom!

12:47.530 --> 12:50.000
Detective!
Communication has been restored!

12:50.000 --> 12:51.140
Very well!

12:51.830 --> 12:53.350
Listen carefully, Neon Lights.

12:53.350 --> 12:58.050
Try to run a little over 700 kilometers
per hour and buy as much time as possible.

12:58.050 --> 12:59.540
Yes, sir. I understand.

12:59.560 --> 13:02.970
But passengers have started
to complain and demand to get off.

13:03.030 --> 13:05.190
We need to do something...

13:06.160 --> 13:07.990
Neon Lights, come in!

13:07.990 --> 13:10.930
Communication has been restored!

13:10.960 --> 13:14.720
A bomb!
There's a bomb on this train!

13:14.830 --> 13:16.770
Let us off right here!

13:16.800 --> 13:18.390
Open the doors right away!

13:18.720 --> 13:19.940
Daddy!

13:20.440 --> 13:22.760
Everyone, please calm down.

13:23.390 --> 13:27.850
There is a possibility that a bomb
is hidden somewhere on this train.

13:28.050 --> 13:33.600
However, Neon Lights and Atom
are both doing their best to find it.

13:33.870 --> 13:39.480
They will protect all of you.
Please have faith in Atom and Neon Lights.

13:39.900 --> 13:44.170
This train is the ultimate robot,
produced by combining the latest technology.

13:44.170 --> 13:46.000
and the visions of many people.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.340
He'll be able to pull
through any crisis.

13:48.430 --> 13:51.340
Have faith in the powers
of robots and humans.

14:06.190 --> 14:09.350
Nope, I don't see a bomb
on the exterior.

14:09.660 --> 14:11.210
This is an emergency announcement.

14:11.210 --> 14:15.260
Neon Lights is heading for
Metro City with a bomb onboard.

14:15.330 --> 14:17.320
Please evacuate immediately!

14:32.680 --> 14:37.170
Oh, God! The Geo Worm is
in Metro City, our final destination!

14:37.270 --> 14:38.740
What did you say?

14:39.020 --> 14:44.210
The rail takes a big turn where
the Geo Worm energy plant is.

14:44.360 --> 14:45.920
Disastrous!

14:46.360 --> 14:48.930
If Neon Lights explodes...

14:48.970 --> 14:51.820
right under the fully loaded
Geo Worm energy plant...

15:00.640 --> 15:04.940
Detective, let's think about how to
get passengers off Neon Lights first.

15:04.940 --> 15:06.600
But how?

15:07.440 --> 15:08.550
Dr. Ochanomizu!

15:08.580 --> 15:13.410
At Point 03, right before we enter Metro City
there is an underground switchyard.

15:13.420 --> 15:17.930
Just before the switchyard is a section
where two rail lines run parallel.

15:18.020 --> 15:20.130
We can have a rescue train
stand by there...

15:20.130 --> 15:23.640
and help all the passengers
transfer to that rescue train.

15:23.640 --> 15:25.520
However, we have only 60 seconds.

15:25.520 --> 15:29.420
When the doors open, move onto
the other train in an orderly manner.

15:31.110 --> 15:33.330
What are you going to do, Neon?

15:33.380 --> 15:35.840
Don't worry about me.

15:42.140 --> 15:43.680
Ready for departure!

15:46.620 --> 15:48.640
Engine, full power!

16:08.280 --> 16:11.520
Oh, no! At that speed,
Neon Lights will catch up fast!

16:16.420 --> 16:18.580
We're gonna crash!

16:31.440 --> 16:33.550
Now! Neon Lights!

16:33.550 --> 16:34.740
Okay!

16:41.420 --> 16:42.950
Dr. Ochanomizu, hurry!

16:42.950 --> 16:46.490
No, I'm staying! Hey! Let go!
I said, I'm staying!

17:14.010 --> 17:15.720
Thank you, Atom!

17:15.750 --> 17:17.900
I'm heading for the city.

17:19.980 --> 17:21.790
Atom!

17:22.150 --> 17:23.400
Neon Lights!

17:23.470 --> 17:25.470
They all got on the other train safely.

17:25.470 --> 17:26.720
I'm happy to hear that.

17:26.720 --> 17:29.240
Now, let's look for the bomb
one more time.

17:29.240 --> 17:33.110
Never mind, Atom.
I'm going to slow down now.

17:33.160 --> 17:36.180
What are you saying?
If you do that...

17:36.230 --> 17:39.260
I'm stopping
before I reach Metro City.

17:39.370 --> 17:42.490
Otherwise, I will involve
too many people in the explosion.

17:42.510 --> 17:45.050
Atom, you must leave me too.

17:45.050 --> 17:49.270
You can't give up! Use your scanner
one more time and we'll find the bomb!

17:49.310 --> 17:54.420
But the bomber said he hid it in
a place where my scanner can't find it.

17:54.480 --> 17:56.140
Yeah, but...

17:56.700 --> 17:59.570
The bomb is hidden in a place...

17:59.570 --> 18:02.810
where even Neon Lights can't find it.

18:03.330 --> 18:07.300
I got it! I know the only place
the scanner can't scan!

18:19.980 --> 18:21.540
I found it!

18:25.960 --> 18:28.530
What? You found the bomb?

18:29.880 --> 18:31.230
I'm glad!

18:31.230 --> 18:34.510
But he's so close to Geo Worm now

18:39.640 --> 18:42.710
Listen up, Atom!
I'm gonna give you directions!

18:42.710 --> 18:45.830
Fly that course at a speed of
over 700 kilometers per hour!

18:45.830 --> 18:47.360
Yes, sir!

19:06.890 --> 19:08.580
All clear. All clear...

19:11.460 --> 19:13.540
Way to go, Atom!

19:17.700 --> 19:23.910
Atom, adjust course 20 degrees to
the right. Make a left in 500 meters.

19:25.390 --> 19:27.180
All clear. All clear...

19:34.680 --> 19:36.950
Atom! The air vent!

20:07.410 --> 20:10.850
Doctor, I successfully detonated
the bomb in space.

20:11.080 --> 20:12.850
Hurrah!

20:15.090 --> 20:18.310
Too bad, but we win.

20:20.290 --> 20:23.130
Sorry to bother you,
but may I have some water?

20:46.240 --> 20:50.330
That was fun!
Let's play again some other time!

20:51.560 --> 20:53.000
See you!

21:07.080 --> 21:10.110
What?
Neon Lights hasn't arrived yet?

21:10.110 --> 21:13.220
That's right.
He should already be here.

21:17.670 --> 21:18.970
This way!

21:19.340 --> 21:22.510
It's all right, Atom.

21:29.630 --> 21:32.380
It's Neon Lights!

21:32.570 --> 21:35.090
Neon Lights has arrived!

21:41.930 --> 21:44.930
My dear passengers,
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

21:45.140 --> 21:50.040
We'll be departing shortly
for our final destination, Metro City.

21:50.100 --> 21:51.970
Neon, you're wonderful!

21:52.160 --> 21:53.970
Stop it!

21:55.270 --> 21:58.110
Well, then, shall we get going?

22:12.050 --> 22:17.580
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.980 --> 22:23.190
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.570 --> 22:29.080
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.360 --> 22:34.660
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.020 --> 22:40.300
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.780 --> 22:48.940
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.340 --> 22:52.220
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.430 --> 23:00.430
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.020 --> 23:03.430
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.860 --> 23:12.140
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.440 --> 23:17.170
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:24.200 --> 23:29.090
Doctor, an unidentified robot has appeared!
It's growing bigger and bigger!

23:29.380 --> 23:32.140
At this rate, Metro City
is in for some major trouble!

23:32.400 --> 23:34.580
Next time:
''Franken''

23:34.760 --> 23:37.670
With your heart... Catch the future!
